Description: Research compendium (raw data and R code) reproducing the analyses
    and figures in Ruan et al. (2025) PNAS 122(14):e2418029122, which reports a
    complete Quina lithic technological system at the Longtan site, Southwest
    China, dated to ca. 60-50 ka.
